y married. However, Alicia and Celis's sister Maya are about to be kidnapped by Prince Ritz of the Kingdom of Windsor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celis, Magic General Lini, and the merchant Riku head out to save Alicia and Maya. However, the Kingdom of Windsor is in an alternate dimension, and to access it, Celis and his companions will have to locate the magic Gemstones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Alicia and Maya attempt to fight back against their captives and flee, they'll be promptly executed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to save them yet, Celis and his companions can only watch events unfold through a crystal ball\u2026 That probably makes this game sound depressing, but it's actually relatively optimistic! If you don't want to play something really dark, don't worry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select the difficulty yourself, but the default difficulty is quite easy, so you can experience the story without any worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/characters.png?t=1758791636\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/f88e017b118c2dd20d503d5e8ca5bb76.avif?t=1758791636\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/9276be9ac7706554fc8b4c2b5e6b8c77.avif?t=1758791636\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/dba0f264f93aa1477421d2f3df317637.avif?t=1758791636\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/gameplay.png?t=1758791636\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/ezgif-5daf8023f5943d.gif?t=1758791636\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/ezgif-53540e4eb6b2d1.gif?t=1758791636\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/ezgif-51100375fe3a65.gif?t=1758791636\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364870/extras/features.png?t=1758791636\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful, vivid fantasy world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning character graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random encounters with tons of different enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An array of different skills and spells for every situation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain EXP and level up, buy better equipment for your party members, and use unique items in battle to ensure victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story in visual novel format</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand even for newcomers to the JRPG genre</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Gyu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/336487